  "description": "C# bindings for Open CASCADE Technology (OCCT) 8.0.1, with OCCT's names, one namespace per OCCT package: geometry, modeling, meshing, shape healing, STEP, IGES, STL and glTF files, OCAF and XCAF documents, and 3D views, with OCCT's documentation in IntelliSense. For .NET Framework 3.5+, .NET 6+ and netstandard2.0, on Windows (x64, x86), Linux (x64) and macOS (arm64).",
  "id": "NetOcc",
  "isPrerelease": true,
