  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Added\n\n- NetOcc.Vtk and NetOcc.Vtk.runtime.<rid>: OCCT's TKIVtk (IVtk, IVtkOCC, IVtkVTK, IVtkTools) on NetVtk, for OCCT shapes in VTK scenes next to simulation results. IVtkTools_ShapeDataSource is a NetVtk vtkPolyDataAlgorithm, IVtkTools_ShapePicker picks shapes and their faces, edges and vertices. It depends on NetOcc of the same version and on exactly one NetVtk release, whose VTK build TKIVtk is compiled against; NetOcc's own packages hold neither TKIVtk nor VTK.",
